Error: Jet.RepeatableKeyUnstable: The `#Repeatable(key: ...)` key on `charge_unstable` reaches `Rand`, so retries would not produce the same key
  --> Tests/UI/Effects/repeatable_key_unstable_is_e0779.jet:5:37
    |
  5 | #Repeatable(key: "order:{order_id}:{make_nonce()}")
    |                                     ^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: An idempotency key deduplicates retries only when every try computes the same key from the call's parameters and constants; randomness or clock time changes on each retry
 Fix: Build `key:` from parameters and constants without calling `Rand` or `Time`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.RepeatableKeyUnstable
